            "review_title": "Review at OCEAN PEARL Island (Hòn Mây Rút Ngoài)",
            "review_text": "Thanh T\nHanoi, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nExperience an island tour. A memorable day.\nFeb 2024 • Family\nI came here at noon, there were many customers that day. Going in by canoe is very tiring, my family and my child get canoe sickness. When the canoe stopped at the island, I went for a tour. There is a very nice check-in area here, with like 8 or so hot photo spots. But at that time I was so hungry that I forgot. The restaurant area is clean, the food is relatively delicious. My family is a solo traveler so we call alacart. Total meal 700k for 2 adults and 3 children.\nMy first friend also doesn't know what island it is. When asked again, this is Hon May outside, my loves.\nApprehend. In the middle of the vast ocean, having this place to rest is very okay.\nGive 5 points.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 4, 2024\nOcean Pearl Island (Hon May Rut Ngoai)\nDear Our Value Customers,\nWarmest greeting from Phu Quoc Ocean Pearl Island.\nThank you very much for your choosing our hotel and thank you for taking your time sharing good experience stay in Phu Quoc Ocean Pearl Island . We sincerely thank the valuable contribution of customers to support the hotel better day by day. We wish you and your family all the bests and hope to welcome you again soon.\nThanks and Regards.\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
