            "review_text": "Hồ Ly Tám Đuôi\nPhu Quoc Island, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nIf I have a chance I will go again\nJun 2023 • Friends\nVery impressive. The clear blue sea and the long white sandy beaches are breathtakingly beautiful in photos. The food is also delicious, with a rich menu to choose from\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten August 25, 2023\nOcean Pearl Island (Hon May Rut Ngoai)\nDear Our Value Customer,\n\nThank you for taking time sharing good experience stay in Phu Quoc Ocean Pearl hotel. We are happy that you enjoyed your stay and loved the service of our staffs and facilities of the hotel. Your nice compliments will be passed down to all staffs, that will encourage our staffs keep on improving the service today and everyday. We wish you and your family all the bests and hope to welcome you again soon.\n\nThanks and Regards,\nPhu Quoc Ocean Pearl\nRead more\nWritten August 25, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
